{"active":"business-as-usual","policy_hash":"{{hash:business-as-usual}}","citation":"Business as usual (business-as-usual@{{hash:business-as-usual}})","postures":[{"slug":"rapid-prototype","name":"Rapid prototype","line":3,"section":"## rapid-prototype\nRapid prototype\n- Ship small experiments quickly; nothing here reaches customers.\n","policy":null,"policy_sha256":null,"policy_hash":null,"citation":"Rapid prototype (rapid-prototype)"},{"slug":"business-as-usual","name":"Business as usual","line":7,"section":"## business-as-usual\nBusiness as usual\n- Steady delivery with the full review on anything user-visible.\n\n```yaml\npolicy:\n  profile_default: spine\n  escalate_on: [one-way-door, U2]\n  gates:\n    premise-gate: lite\n    sdk-check: once-at-end\n    research: off\n  close:\n    tpm-report: file-only\n  signoff:\n    one-way: human\n    two-way: self\n    unlock: off\n  user_impact:\n    U1: [revert-path, e2e]\n  lifts:\n    U0: R2\n    U1:cross-repo-seam: R1\n  remediate:\n    on: [final-gates-fail]\n    max_rounds: 3\n  ask:\n    two_way_timeout: 24h\n    digest: daily\n    session_budget: 3\n```\n","policy":{"profile_default":"spine","escalate_on":["one-way-door","U2"],"gates":{"premise-gate":"lite","sdk-check":"once-at-end","research":"off"},"signoff":{"one-way":"human","two-way":"self","unlock":"off"},"close":{"tpm-report":"file-only"},"lifts":{"U0":"R2","U1:cross-repo-seam":"R1"},"remediate":{"on":["final-gates-fail"],"max_rounds":3},"ask":{"two_way_timeout":"24h","digest":"daily","session_budget":3},"user_impact":{"U1":["revert-path","e2e"]}},"policy_sha256":"{{sha256:business-as-usual}}","policy_hash":"{{hash:business-as-usual}}","citation":"Business as usual (business-as-usual@{{hash:business-as-usual}})"},{"slug":"lock-in","name":"Lock in","line":39,"section":"## lock-in\nLock in\n- Everything gets the deep profile and a human signs every door.\n\n```yaml\npolicy:\n  profile_default: deep\n  signoff:\n    one-way: human\n    two-way: human\n    raise:\n      \"*\":\n        merge: [adversarial-review:max]\n  ceilings:\n    all: R1\n    U3: R0\n  user_impact:\n    U0: [revert-path]\n    U1: [revert-path, e2e]\n```\n","policy":{"profile_default":"deep","signoff":{"one-way":"human","two-way":"human","raise":{"*":{"merge":["adversarial-review:max"]}}},"ceilings":{"all":"R1","U3":"R0"},"user_impact":{"U0":["revert-path"],"U1":["revert-path","e2e"]}},"policy_sha256":"{{sha256:lock-in}}","policy_hash":"{{hash:lock-in}}","citation":"Lock in (lock-in@{{hash:lock-in}})"}]}
